WEBVTT

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:33.841
And occasionally, on 
the very same day,

00:02:33.841 --> 00:02:37.620
I went on rounds at 
UCLA Medical Center

00:02:37.620 --> 00:02:40.523
and at the Los Angeles Zoo.

00:02:40.523 --> 00:02:46.861
And here's what started coming
into very clear focus for me.

00:02:46.861 --> 00:02:51.167
Physicians and veterinarians
were essentially taking care

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:56.337
of the same disorders in their 
animal and human patients:

00:02:56.337 --> 00:03:00.850
congestive heart failure, brain tumors,